  "title": "BCG Chooses BXP’s Met Square",
  "summary": "BOSTON PROPERTIES ANNOUNCES 98,000 SQUARE FOOT, 12-YEAR LEASE WITH BOSTON CONSULTING GROUP BOSTON, MA, May 6, 2021 – Boston Properties, Inc. (NYSE: BXP), the largest publicly traded developer, owner, and manager of Class A office properties in the United States, announced today it has signed a 98,000 square foot, 12-year lease with Boston Consulting Group […]",
